// expect-error: NITPICK-RESOLVE-008
//
// A wildcard brings in `shared` and this file declares one. The LOCAL WINS -- a
// file's own declarations cannot be at the mercy of what a dependency exports
// this week -- and the collision is worth a word, because a bare name that two
// things could plausibly mean is exactly what wildcard imports are known for.
use "../vis/lib.npk".*;
pub func:shared = int32() never fails { pass 1i32; };
